1. USDEL ARRIVES MOSCOW SEPT. 29 ON BE672 AT 1620.
2. USDEL: WILLIAM A. RADLINSKI, ASSOCIATE DIRECTOR,
US GEOLOGICAL SURVEY; RICHARD B. KRAHL, CHIEF MARINE
OIL AND GASS OPERATIONS, USGS; HILLARY A. ODEN, USGS;
DOUGLAS C. ALVERSON, USGS; WARREN M. MARSHALL,
CHAIRMAN, OFFSHORE OPERATORS' COMMITTEE; THOMAS A.
COLLINS, DISTRICT MANAGER, PLACID OIL COMPANY;
L.C. SOILEAU III, PRESIDENT, CHEVRON OIL COMPANY;
ALDEN J. LABORDE, PRESIDENT, OCEAN DRILLING AND
EXPLORATIONS CO. RUSH

1. AT THEIR MEETING ON NOVMEMBER 14, THE PERMANENT
REPRESENTATIVES OF THE EC MEMBER STATES SIGNIFICANTLY
EXPANDED THE CALENDAR OF COUNCIL MEETINGS FOR THE MONTH OF
DECEMBER. THE CALENDAR, WHICH IS GIVEN IN FULL BELOW,
IS, AS ALWAYS, SUBJECT TO LAST MINUTE ALTERATION.
2. DECEMBER 2 AND 3 - FOREIGN AFFAIRS:
DECEMBER 9 AND 10 -AGRICULTURE;
DECEMBER 12 - TRANSPORT;
DECEMBER 16 - SOCIAL AFFAIRS AND FINANCE;
DECEMBER 17 - ENERGY;
DECEMBER 19 - DEVELOPMENT ASSISTANCE;
DECEMBER 20 - INDUSTRIAL AFFAIRS.MYERSON

