Subject: 6.6 Magnitude Earthquake Strikes Southeastern Turkey (U)

(U) Some buildings have collapsed in the eastern city of Van, media report. USGS issued a notice highlighting
the probability of casualties and extensive damage.




      UNCLASSIFIED U.S. Department of State Case No. F-2014-20439 Doc No. C05784293 Date: 10/30/2015

